    {
      "conditions": [],
      "definition": "The Project Reference-Frame Basis starter projects PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md section 7. Its completed declaration requires admission through existing Product, requirement, Goals, accepted-design, identity, work or release authorities owning its decisions; the starter itself is not authority.",
      "exceptions": [],
      "grounding": [
        {
          "end_line": 7,
          "quote": "This starter projects\n`PRODUCT_DEFINITION.md#7-collective-reference-frame-basis`. It is not\nauthority. Replace every placeholder and admit the completed declaration\nthrough the existing Product, requirement, Goals, accepted-design, identity,\nwork, or release authorities that own its decisions.",
          "section_id": "repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/templates/PROJECT_REFERENCE_FRAME_BASIS_TEMPLATE.md#Project%20Reference-Frame%20Basis",
