          "start_line": 243
        }
      ],
      "key": "overlay_structural_contract",
      "statement": "The root is an object requiring exactly the declared root fields $schema, kind, product, constitution, local_constitution, reference_frame_bases, what, how, ticketing and composition; kind is stdo.product-definition and $schema is referenceUri. Every object shape defined in this schema excludes additional properties. Product requires definition_id: identityUri, nonempty string name, source_project: referenceUri and bounded_context. The bounded_context property is required but its value is either null or an object requiring id: identityUri and definition: referenceUri; it describes an optional enclosing context, not an exhaustive registry of subordinate, peer, composed, tenant, user or runtime contexts.",
      "uncertainty": ""
    },
    {
      "applies_to_keys": ["product_definition_schema"],
      "conditions": ["Structural validation against the supplied schema."],
      "exceptions": [],
      "grounding": [
